    "index.limits.the-focus-zoom-guard-overrides-the-2": "The focus-zoom guard overrides the content font size: on a phone the editor is fixed at 17px, so the “small” setting no longer applies to it. Dropping back to 14px brings the zoom right back — a trade-off, not an oversight.",
